{
 "_comment": "Shared detector test vectors. Both the Swift (macos/) and TypeScript (desktop/) detectors must satisfy every case. 'detectors': null/absent = all enabled. mode 'exact' (default) compares the sorted list of matched substrings; 'contains' checks each expected string is matched. 'text' and each 'expect' entry may be an array of strings that are concatenated (used to keep secret-shaped literals out of the repo so secret scanners stay quiet).",
